The SVG files in 16/ and 20/ are icons from @blueprintjs/icons 6.17.0, the icon set of
Palantir's Blueprint, written out from its path data (src/generated/16px/paths and
src/generated/20px/paths) without change. x.svg and caret-right.svg come from the package's
newer icon set (src/next/generated/paths), which draws each icon once on a 16 px grid; the 20/
copy of each is that drawing scaled to 20 px, as the set's own icon container scales it.

